    <string name="text_receive_from_phone">Receive from phone</string>
    <string name="text_receive_hint">Scan the code with a phone on the same network, or open the address in a browser there, and send a tt:// link or a TOML file. If the page doesn’t open, turn off the phone’s VPN. Use a network you trust: the link crosses it unencrypted. This works once, for 5 minutes.</string>
